<title>JAPAN: Hankyu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hankyu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		109.36		vs	   90.82</p>
<p> Operating	   14.96		vs	    8.22</p>
<p> Current	 prft 5.03		vs     loss 1.26</p>
<p> Net	     prft 2.73		vs     loss 5.94</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 3.18 yen	  vs     loss 6.92 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    858 million	  vs	 858 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  1.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hankyu Corp is a leading railway company in the Kansai area.</p>
</text>
